flowchart LR
    Trader[Trader / analyst] --> UI[React + Vite + Recharts]
    UI -->|HTTPS JSON| API[FastAPI / Pydantic]
    API --> Analytics[As-of selection + Pandas metrics]
    Analytics --> Snapshot[Versioned CSV snapshots]
    CLI[Acquisition CLI / token-protected refresh] --> Client[HTTPX retries / two concurrent requests]
